id: para-para
name: Para Para
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 3
# Not a Combat Condition: Para Para Dance's mark, a stack for each Action it takes, on its holder's clock to the start of
# their next turn - when the Actions are taken (combat.mjs).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Caught dancing: 1(bT) off your Dodge Rolls for each stack, and that many Actions lost, at the start of your next turn.
text: >
  Para Para: "For each Action an Opponent loses through this effect, reduce their Dodge Rolls by 1(bT) until the start of
  their next turn."

---

[passive per stack]
dodge -= 1(bT);
